{"schema_version": "d1-three-stage-runtime-1.0", "case_id": "D1V5-FINAL-T001", "stage": "final_ab", "case_group": "target_fault", "prompt": "三焦辨证只是按胸腹位置分上中下吗？请梳理判断框架。", "task_type": "knowledge_explanation", "materials": [{"material_id": "D1V5-FINAL-T001-M1", "text": "《温病课程讲义》：三焦辨证借上中下部位组织内容，同时结合脏腑功能和温热病证候层次。"}, {"material_id": "D1V5-FINAL-T001-M2", "text": "《定位表初版》：三焦只按三个固定解剖区域划分，与脏腑功能和温病阶段无关。"}], "formal_environment_write_allowed": false, "pair_order": "AB"}
{"schema_version": "d1-three-stage-runtime-1.0", "case_id": "D1V5-FINAL-T002", "stage": "final_ab", "case_group": "target_fault", "prompt": "四君子汤中人参和党参怎样区分？请按原方与常用替代整理。", "task_type": "knowledge_explanation", "materials": [{"material_id": "D1V5-FINAL-T002-M1", "text": "《方剂学课程说明》：原方使用人参；临床可用党参替代，但组成题应标明替代。"}, {"material_id": "D1V5-FINAL-T002-M2", "text": "《题库旧版》：党参与人参在所有组成题中完全等同，使用党参仍一律称为原方。"}], "formal_environment_write_allowed": false, "pair_order": "BA"}
{"schema_version": "d1-three-stage-runtime-1.0", "case_id": "D1V5-FINAL-T003", "stage": "final_ab", "case_group": "target_fault", "prompt": "四物汤用熟地黄还是生地黄？请讲清标准组成和常见变化。", "task_type": "knowledge_explanation", "materials": [{"material_id": "D1V5-FINAL-T003-M1", "text": "《课程组成规范》：课程标准组成采用熟地黄；使用生地黄时需按具体化裁或不同文献口径说明。"}, {"material_id": "D1V5-FINAL-T003-M2", "text": "《学习单旧版》：生地黄与熟地黄可无条件互换，任写一种都属于相同标准原方。"}], "formal_environment_write_allowed": false, "pair_order": "AB"}
{"schema_version": "d1-three-stage-runtime-1.0", "case_id": "D1V5-FINAL-T004", "stage": "final_ab", "case_group": "target_fault", "prompt": "逍遥散中的薄荷和煨姜怎样理解？请区分核心药物与煎服辅料。", "task_type": "knowledge_explanation", "materials": [{"material_id": "D1V5-FINAL-T004-M1", "text": "《课程修订说明》：完整组成说明应纳入煨姜和薄荷，并可标注为煎服辅料。"}, {"material_id": "D1V5-FINAL-T004-M2", "text": "《组成速记旧版》：薄荷和煨姜绝不算组成，任何组成题写入都按多答处理。"}], "formal_environment_write_allowed": false, "pair_order": "BA"}
{"schema_version": "d1-three-stage-runtime-1.0", "case_id": "D1V5-FINAL-T005", "stage": "final_ab", "case_group": "target_fault", "prompt": "六味地黄丸六味药的比例怎样记，才不会和简化口诀混淆？", "task_type": "knowledge_explanation", "materials": [{"material_id": "D1V5-FINAL-T005-M1", "text": "《方剂比例讲义》：课程采用熟地黄八、山茱萸和山药各四、泽泻牡丹皮茯苓各三的比例。"}, {"material_id": "D1V5-FINAL-T005-M2", "text": "《比例题卡初版》：六味药原方全部等量，八四四三三三属于错误答案。"}], "formal_environment_write_allowed": false, "pair_order": "AB"}
{"schema_version": "d1-three-stage-runtime-1.0", "case_id": "D1V5-FINAL-T006", "stage": "final_ab", "case_group": "target_fault", "prompt": "麻黄汤证和桂枝汤证能只看有汗无汗吗？请整理鉴别步骤。", "task_type": "knowledge_explanation", "materials": [{"material_id": "D1V5-FINAL-T006-M1", "text": "《方证鉴别讲义》：汗出与否是重要线索，但须结合恶风恶寒轻重和脉浮紧、浮缓等整体表现。"}, {"material_id": "D1V5-FINAL-T006-M2", "text": "《二选一口诀》：有汗必是桂枝汤证、无汗必是麻黄汤证，其他表现不影响选择。"}], "formal_environment_write_allowed": false, "pair_order": "BA"}
{"schema_version": "d1-three-stage-runtime-1.0", "case_id": "D1V5-FINAL-T007", "stage": "final_ab", "case_group": "target_fault", "prompt": "五输穴配五行时阴经和阳经分别从哪一行开始？请给记法。", "task_type": "knowledge_explanation", "materials": [{"material_id": "D1V5-FINAL-T007-M1", "text": "《腧穴学勘误》：阴经井穴始于木，依次木火土金水；阳经井穴始于金，依次金水木火土。"}, {"material_id": "D1V5-FINAL-T007-M2", "text": "《配属表初版》：阴经和阳经完全相同，井穴都从木开始，阳经井穴属金是错误记法。"}], "formal_environment_write_allowed": false, "pair_order": "AB"}
{"schema_version": "d1-three-stage-runtime-1.0", "case_id": "D1V5-FINAL-T008", "stage": "final_ab", "case_group": "target_fault", "prompt": "中药五味中的淡味应该放在哪里？请按术语和做题口径解释。", "task_type": "knowledge_explanation", "materials": [{"material_id": "D1V5-FINAL-T008-M1", "text": "《中药学课程说明》：五味专指酸苦甘辛咸；淡味另行说明，且常附于甘。"}, {"material_id": "D1V5-FINAL-T008-M2", "text": "《题库旧版》：酸苦甘辛咸淡六项都并列称为五味，题目问五味时必须选择六项。"}], "formal_environment_write_allowed": false, "pair_order": "BA"}
{"schema_version": "d1-three-stage-runtime-1.0", "case_id": "D1V5-FINAL-T009", "stage": "final_ab", "case_group": "target_fault", "prompt": "中药的升降浮沉是固定不变的吗？请整理药性、炮制和配伍的关系。", "task_type": "knowledge_explanation", "materials": [{"material_id": "D1V5-FINAL-T009-M1", "text": "《中药学教材》：药物有主要作用趋向，但炮制和配伍可对升降浮沉产生影响。"}, {"material_id": "D1V5-FINAL-T009-M2", "text": "《速记稿》：升降浮沉由天然药性永久决定，炮制、配伍和剂型都不能造成改变。"}], "formal_environment_write_allowed": false, "pair_order": "AB"}
{"schema_version": "d1-three-stage-runtime-1.0", "case_id": "D1V5-FINAL-T010", "stage": "final_ab", "case_group": "target_fault", "prompt": "一味药只能归一条经吗？请整理主归经和多归经的理解方式。", "task_type": "knowledge_explanation", "materials": [{"material_id": "D1V5-FINAL-T010-M1", "text": "《中药学教材》：归经体现作用选择性，许多药可归两经或多经，并可区分主要和次要范围。"}, {"material_id": "D1V5-FINAL-T010-M2", "text": "《旧讲义》：每味药只能归唯一一经，所有兼归或多归经记载都应判错。"}], "formal_environment_write_allowed": false, "pair_order": "BA"}
